  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of <math><mn>50</mn></math> terms of the series <math><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>.</mo></math> is equal to <math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></msub></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>12500</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
